WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
I am familiar with all hotel systems

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,160
Responsible for daily management and job coordination

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,040
When you need to fight, listen to the leader's unified arrangements

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,440
First restore water purification and power generation before tonight

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,160
List all entrances and exits clearly

6
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,800
Everyone else’s abilities are registered

7
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,560
What is your willpower? What is my willpower?

8
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:16,370
Can you tell if a person is loyal?

9
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:17,890
You said you don’t know Ji Chuan

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,090
But you live in his house

11
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:21,330
Almost all my food for two years came from him.

12
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:22,370
These records cannot prove

13
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,730
That monster is Ji Chuan

14
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:25,850
ID photo and facial features of Target No. 1

15
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:26,850
Completely corresponding

16
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,290
Your parents are not telling the truth

17
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:30,170
He also took the initiative to order the divisions to stop attacking

18
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,370
I ask again

19
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:32,570
Why is Ji Chuan looking for you?

20
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,730
Who killed your parents?

21
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,610
There's something wrong with too many people here

22
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,090
I can't talk about these investigations in front of everyone.

23
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,330
Have you reported it to Director Li?

24
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,250
Not yet

25
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,970
I want to give you a chance to explain first

26
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,810
It's zero zero outside the base tonight.

27
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:45,010
I tell you everything
